{'symbol': 'BWA', 'date': '2021-05-21 13:32:00', 'title': '2021 LOUIS SCHWITZER AWARD HONORS BIOMEDICAL ENGINEERING FOR INDYCAR® DRIVER SAFETY', 'text': 'INDIANAPOLIS, MAY 21, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE 55TH ANNUAL LOUIS SCHWITZER AWARD WAS PRESENTED TO TERRY TRAMMELL, M.D., FOR HIS WORK ON BIOMEDICAL ENGINEERING FOR INDYCAR® DRIVER SAFETY EARLIER TODAY AT THE INDIANAPOLIS MOTOR SPEEDWAY (IMS).'}